          "filename": "Perdana Leadership Foundation 20250821 (19).jpg",
          "caption": "The Perdana Leadership Foundation (PLF), established in 2003, is a non-profit organization founded by Malaysia’s fourth and seventh Prime Minister, Tun Dr. Mahathir Mohamad. The foundation’s main goal is to preserve, study, and promote Malaysia’s leadership heritage, with a focus on the policies, speeches, and achievements of past prime ministers. Through its extensive digital archives, publications, and educational programs, the foundation seeks to inspire future generations to understand and emulate the values of visionary and ethical leadership.",
